jobs.desc:
- Development and maintenance of front-end applications, taking ownership of the projects' user-facing experience;
- Design and prototyping of interfaces using Figma, from initial concepts to implementation;
- Development within an AI-first workflow, leveraging tools such as Claude to assist with implementation, refactoring, code analysis and problem-solving;
- Collaboration on technical and product decisions, bridging interface design and software development;

- Development of a mobile application integrated with GIS technologies;
- Responsible for front-end architecture, feature implementation, versioning and sprint deliveries;
- Collaboration with cross-functional teams to ensure consistent UX and high-quality deliverables;
- Maintenance, optimization and evolution of core application modules;

- Active participation in the development and evolution of a YMS web application built with Laravel + Vue.js, delivering continuous improvements in usability, performance and scalability;
- Implementation and deployment of an Android mobile application using React Native + Expo, integrating native features and expanding the solution's reach;
- Delivery of high-impact features aligned with best practices in UX and software architecture;
- Definition and promotion of development best practices within the team, including clean code, Conventional Commits and improvements to version control workflows;

- Development of interactive applications focused on GIS (Geographic Information Systems), using React, TypeScript, ArcGIS API and Experience Builder custom widgets;
- Creation of Python scripts for workflow automation and geospatial data processing;
- Participation in technical consulting for mapping and development systems, supporting clients in the design and implementation of GIS solutions;
